[32m+[m[32m## Nerve Ending Sidecar[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEach service can be deployed with a nerve ending sidecar that:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Monitors CPU, memory, error rate, latency[m
[32m+[m[32m- Publishes alerts to NATS (`nerve.{service}.alert`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Recommends remediation actions[m
[32m+[m[32m- Triggers reflex isolation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Alert Types[m
[32m+[m[32m- `cpu_high` - CPU usage exceeds threshold[m
[32m+[m[32m- `memory_high` - Memory usage exceeds threshold[m
[32m+[m[32m- `error_rate_high` - Error rate exceeds threshold[m
[32m+[m[32m- `latency_high` - Average latency exceeds threshold[m
[32m+[m[32m- `health_check_failed` - Health endpoint failures[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Recommended Actions[m
[32m+[m[32m- `scale_horizontal` - Add more replicas[m
[32m+[m[32m- `restart_pod` - Restart the problematic pod[m
[32m+[m[32m- `isolate_pod` - Remove from load balancer[m
[32m+[m[32m- `traffic_shift` - Redirect traffic to healthy pods[m
[32m+[m[32m- `circuit_breaker` - Enable circuit breaker[m
